.TH SDL_FRect 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_FRect \- A rectangle stored using floating point values.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_rect.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef struct SDL_FRect
.BI "{
.BI "    float x;
.BI "    float y;
.BI "    float w;
.BI "    float h;
.BI "} SDL_FRect;
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The origin of the coordinate space is in the top-left, with increasing values moving down and right\[char46] The properties
.BR x
and
.BR y
represent the coordinates of the top-left corner of the rectangle\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This struct is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_RectEmptyFloat (3),
